# Autopilot run state. The spec, plan and review artifacts are committed on purpose —
# they are the record of what a run was asked to do and what it concluded. Everything
# else here is per-run scratch: the control channel, the orchestrator's own bookkeeping,
# and the transcript. The doer contract already says not to commit these; this is what
# stops an unfinished run from leaving a dirty tree that blocks a release.
.autopilot*/state.json
.autopilot*/runtime.json
.autopilot*/cost.json
.autopilot*/transcript.md
.autopilot*/log.md
.autopilot*/learnings.md
.autopilot*/final-summary.md
.autopilot*/debug/
.autopilot*/inbox/
.autopilot*/outbox/
